{
  "_about": "Admissibility (ADR-052, Directive §9/§6) cross-language vectors. A grant is a bounded authority; check_admissibility decides if a specific action falls within it. grant canonical bytes = Rule-A canonical JSON (recursive key-sort, compact, UTF-8, null-omitted). Decimal amounts compared with a no-float portable algorithm. Engine quesen.evidence.admissibility, python quesen_sdk.admissibility, and JS admissibility.ts MUST all reproduce admissible+violations+hashes identically.",
